<title>USA: San Antonio $599 mln bonds repriced, yields cut.</title>
<headline>San Antonio $599 mln bonds repriced, yields cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc. said Tuesday it repriced San Antonio, Texas's $599 million electric system bond deal, lowering yields in several maturities but leaving the top yield in 2020 unchanged at 5.75 percent.</p>
